    "text": "newportdispatch.com\nwebsite\nSomerset\nSomerset police arrest Rhode Island man in gas station robbery\nBy Daniel Duric,\n1 hours agoSOMERSET — Somerset police have arrested a 58-year-old Rhode Island man in connection with a robbery at a local gas station. James P. Spader of North Kingstown, Rhode Island, was taken into custody at a North Attleboro motel hours after the June 17 incident at the SAV-ON gas station at 1693 G.A.R. Highway.\n1",
